@startuml
title UniLib PA3 — Fulfill held reservation — UC-11
autonumber
skinparam shadowing false
participant "Librarian" as p0
participant "Hold Shelf" as p1
participant "F05 API" as p2
participant "Reservation module" as p3
participant "PostgreSQL" as p4
p0 -> p1 : Select Ready reservation and copy
p1 -> p2 : Held checkout request (route TBD)
p2 -> p3 : fulfillHeldReservation(tx,readerId,copyId,now)
p3 -> p4 : Verify owner/deadline, loan + copy state in same transaction
p2 -> p1 : Success or HOLD_NOT_ELIGIBLE
p1 --> p2 : result
note over p0,p4
alt: wrong owner, expired hold, concurrency conflict; authorization and response require backend test.
end note
@enduml
